    ],
    "note": "VID:PID FFFF:2055 and HID name 'Rhino FFB Joystick' read from the user's own Rhino (JoyPro engine devices list). DirectInput: axes JOY_Z, JOY_Y, JOY_X, JOY_RY, JOY_RX, JOY_RZ, JOY_SLIDER1 (7 axes), 64 buttons, 4 hats - identical for every grip (grip chosen in the VPforce Configurator Grip Type; the firmware always exposes 64 buttons / 4 hats). Which grip axes (analog brake lever, ministick, Virpil axes) land on Z/RX/RY/RZ/SLIDER1 is configurable and was not documented. TelemFFB (software, not a device) adds telemetry effects for DCS/MSFS/X-Plane. VPforce documents no default per-grip button numbering; buttons can be remapped per physical button in the Configurator Button Mapping tab."
